Same upstream-compiled bytecode; ReleaseFast process startup and image loading included.
Samples: 21 per engine, 3 warmups; values are median wall time.

| Workload | mqjs ms | zrun ms | mqjs/zrun |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| arithmetic | 13.951 | 18.980 | 0.73x |
| arrays | 1.149 | 1.134 | 1.01x |
| calls | 3.989 | 5.376 | 0.74x |
| ssr | 0.864 | 1.482 | 0.58x |

| Executable | File bytes |
|---|---:|
| mqjs (-Os, debug sections stripped) | 240,232 |
| zrun (ReleaseSmall, debug sections stripped) | 984,376 |
| zrun (ReleaseFast, debug sections stripped) | 2,198,480 |
| ReleaseFast before stripping | 13,443,928 |
| ReleaseSmall before stripping | 984,376 |

Timing ratio above 1.00x means zrun was faster for that workload.
